This is just a reminder to all that the Bioconductor list is 'members
only'.  Of course, if you're getting this, then you're registered as a
member, but one problem that occurs from time to time is that people's
membership email address (the one that this message is sent to) is
different then the one that is used when sending email.  The software that
runs the mailing list can't tell the difference here, so for example:

If you're registered as:
jane@foo.com
But your mail gets sent as being from:
jane@xyz.foo.com

Your message will be blocked as if you were not a member of the
list.  So if something like this happens to you, please first check your
listed email address on the mailing list site, and compare it to the
'from' address on your outgoing email.

Thanks,
-Jeff

